  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fiscal Strengthening Program for Inclusive Growth</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Fortalecimiento Fiscal para el Crecimiento Inclusivo</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general de desarrollo del programa es fortalecer la sostenibilidad fiscal de Honduras. Lo anterior se sustenta a su vez en dos Objetivos Especficos de Desarrollo: (i) fortalecer la gestin macrofiscal a travs de la mejora del marco de responsabilidad fiscal; y (ii)aumentar la efectividad de la poltica de ingresos y la gestin del gasto pblico.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall development objective of the program is to strengthen Honduras&apos; fiscal sustainability. This is supported by two specific development objectives: (i) strengthening macrofiscal management by improving the fiscal responsibility framework; and (ii) increasing the effectiveness of revenue policy and public expenditure management.</narrative>
  </description>
